{'symbol': 'IBM', 'date': '2023-02-07 00:00:00', 'title': 'ROSEN, SKILLED INVESTOR COUNSEL, ENCOURAGES INTERNATIONAL BUSINESS MACHINES CORPORATION INVESTORS WITH LOSSES TO SECURE COUNSEL BEFORE IMPORTANT DEADLINE IN SECURITIES CLASS ACTION COMMENCED BY THE FIRM - IBM', 'text': 'NEW YORK , FEB. 7, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- WHY:\xa0ROSEN LAW FIRM, A GLOBAL INVESTOR RIGHTS LAW FIRM, REMINDS PURCHASERS OF THE SECURITIES OF INTERNATIONAL BUSINESS MACHINES CORPORATION (NYSE: IBM) BETWEEN JANUARY 18, 2018 AND OCTOBER 16, 2018, BOTH DATES INCLUSIVE (THE "CLASS PERIOD") OF THE IMPORTANT\xa0MARCH 14, 2023 LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE.\xa0 SO WHAT:\xa0IF YOU INVESTED IN IBM SECURITIES DURING THE CLASS PERIOD YOU MAY BE ENTITLED TO COMPENSATION WITHOUT PAYMENT OF ANY OUT OF POCKET FEES OR COSTS THROUGH A CONTINGENCY FEE ARRANGEMENT.'}{'symbol': 'IBM', 'date': '2023-02-06 22:22:00', 'title': 'SHAREHOLDER ALERT: POMERANTZ LAW FIRM INVESTIGATES CLAIMS ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS OF INTERNATIONAL BUSINESS MACHINES CORPORATION - IBM', 'text': 'NEW YORK , FEB. 6, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- POMERANTZ LLP IS INVESTIGATING CLAIMS ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS OF\xa0\xa0INTERNATIONAL BUSINESS MACHINES CORPORATION\xa0("IBM" OR THE "COMPANY")\xa0(NYSE:\xa0IBM).\xa0 SUCH INVESTORS ARE ADVISED TO CONTACT ROBERT S.'}